# Decisions

## Architecture decision records

### ADR-001 — Server-rendered monolith

**Status:** accepted

**Context.** A small habit tracker with modest scale and one primary actor.

**Decision.** Run a single Next.js app with an integrated API rather than separate services.

**Consequences.** Simplest to build and deploy; revisit only if scale demands separation.

## Irreversible decisions — confirm before you build

### IRR-1 — Authentication model

People sign in with an email and password you store yourself.

**If you change this later:** Switching to Google/Apple sign-in later means migrating every account.

**Your call:** Confirmed ✓ on 2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z

### IRR-2 — Relational data model

Habits and check-ins live in tables with fixed columns.

**If you change this later:** Reshaping to a document store later is a full data migration.

**Your call:** Confirmed ✓ on 2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z

### IRR-3 — Single-region hosting

Everything runs in one region close to your first users.

**If you change this later:** Going multi-region later means re-architecting data residency.

**Not confirmed — revisit before building.**
"
`;
